# Check out text files with LF everywhere, Windows included. The shipped demo page is
# compared byte for byte with what `tps2 view` writes (always LF), and Git for Windows
# would otherwise convert it to CRLF on checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.tif binary
*.nc binary
*.png binary
*.whl binary
# Vendored third-party files keep their bytes exactly (their checksums are recorded).
topopyscale2/outputs/dashboard_assets/vendor/** -text
